                <div type="edition" xml:lang="okz-Latn" rendition="class:83231 maturity:83213">
<p>
   <lb n="1"/><gap reason="illegible" extent="unknown" unit="character"/>
   <lb n="2"/><supplied reason="lost">pi</supplied>ṅ ta pramān· vrai vekk· droṅ<unclear>·</unclear> gi piṅ<unclear>·</unclear> puneṅṅ<unclear>·</unclear> ñaṅ·
   <lb n="3"/>piṅ· karohv<unclear>·</unclear> grāṅ· gi piṅ· tallauhv<unclear>·</unclear> gi tel· Oy·
   <lb n="4"/>ta vraḥ kammratāṅ· Añ· svayaṁbhū droṅ· kpoñ· kaṁmratāṅ·
   <lb n="5"/>Añ· bha nāriyya <g ref="sym:floret" type="punctuation">.</g> ni gi piṅ· stuk· cik· gi tel· Oy·
   <lb n="6"/>ta vraḥ kaṁmratāṅ· Añ· śrī śaṅkaranārāyanaṁ ru gi Ākara ta
   <lb n="7"/>mān<unclear>·</unclear> Aṁvi ta gi gi tel· Oy ta vraḥ kaṁmratāṅ· Añ<unclear>·</unclear>
   <lb n="8"/>śrī jāyadeva paṁre yok· Oy· <gap reason="lost" extent="unknown" unit="character"/>
</p>     
</div>
